    "goal": "Repair testCounters ambiguity and accounting validation in the existing development-tooling helper. Repeated summary labels or contradictory totals must return null; preserve legitimate summaries and existing object-or-null API. This new task also verifies the unchanged post-HELD role adapter through all four native roles.",
