      "Preserve current supported TAP (#) and spec (info symbol) summaries, CRLF input, incidental non-summary output and valid zero-test/skipped/todo summaries. Parsing a skipped/todo summary does not make execution PASS.",
      "Add meaningful regressions for duplicates, mismatched totals, missing counters and unsafe values, plus valid zero/skipped/todo and both supported reporter formats. Preserve all existing assertions, verifyRedGreen behavior and other helpers.",
